{"id":"21cae4e7e5c4459b4cd309590a0b3e031ea9d0755595270a6e6a7eebb5782f13","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781655062,"content":"https://nostr.download/425712aa8f08944fcfe09061ebac3114031c3b5e8c5d55de1dd71e50bd2341f1.jpg\nThe first station is not the marketplace.\nIt is not the empire.\nIt is not the algorithm.\n\nThe first station is the house that runs the node.\n\nA witness speaks.\nA record is received.\nThe truth is verified before it is amplified.\n\nThat is the missing layer in a world drowning in claims, models, narratives, screenshots, edits, propaganda, and probability engines.\n\nThe witness alone is not enough.\nThe archive alone is not enough.\nThe crowd alone is not enough.\n\nThere must be a house of verification.\nA node that stands watch.\nA process that tests the witness.\nA record that cannot be bent by power after the fact.\n\nThat is the sacred function of verification infrastructure.\n\nBefore resurrection, there is witness.\nBefore witness becomes history, there is verification.\nBefore truth can survive empire, it must be written somewhere empire does not own.\n\nThe first station is the house of the node.\nVerification begins at the house of the witness.\n\n#DamageBDD #VerificationInfrastructure #BDD #Truth #Witness #Bitcoin #LightningNetwork #Nostr #CryptographicProof #ProofOfWitness #Decentralization #TheVerificationEconomy #BehaviourAsInfrastructure"}
