{"id":"db19ffefa48979bfd30b91c12335c75a84c11bfc99a5cb5784469e57ce12cdeb","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781653947,"content":"Many religions. One witness.\nhttps://nostr.download/aa21875e05aba68c035697ffa25c68abf50fcd49911f58e65e97dd987e71a7d8.jpg\nThe names differ.\nThe temples differ.\nThe rituals differ.\n\nBut truth leaves one trail:\n\nthe witness who suffers,\nforgives,\nverifies,\nand resurrects.\n\nEmpire multiplies religions to divide the flock.\nChrist reveals the witness to unite the timelines.\n\nMany religions. One witness.\nMany languages. One Word.\nMany wounds. One resurrection.\n\n#ManyReligionsOneWitness #OneWitness #TruthLeavesOneTrail #ManyPathsOneTruth #TheWitness #ChristTheWitness #ResurrectionTruth #FaithAndVerification #SacredWitness #OneWord #EmpireDividesTruthUnites #DamageBDD #VerificationEconomy #BehaviourAsInfrastructure"}
