{"id":"724a225cd7bd08a0a1bd4e7715907c89de7785f16c75dca7c02f743443659eeb","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781653757,"content":"https://nostr.download/d61bdaea40cf9f99c5dc830f9b060a50e92c9f1983f08ca25d6d280467bfd2ea.jpg\nMeditate.\nForgive forward.\nForgive backward.\nForgive for the generations who could not name the wound.\n\nIn every timeline where death claims the final word, Christ overturns the verdict.\n\nHe is not merely comfort after loss.\nHe is the destroyer of death.\nThe resurrection written into flesh.\nThe Saviour who breaks the curse at the root.\n\nDeath does not get the last word.\nChrist does.\n\nReferences: John 11:25–26, 1 Corinthians 15:54–57, Revelation 21:4, Hebrews 2:14.\n\n#ChristIsRisen #DestroyerOfDeath #ResurrectionPower #ForgiveForward #ForgiveBackward #DeathDefeated #ChristTheSaviour #MeditateForgiveResurrect #TheLastWordIsChrist #VictoryOverDeath #John1125 #Corinthians15 #Hebrews214 #FaithOverFear #KingdomSignal"}
{"id":"6f207d946527f5f015cf5a735d00c32d9a3e0a2277653c52f99d6d4492cb50e7","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781653723,"content":"https://nostr.download/ac4fb1027ae0adc656d426d26a93ea981019ef507388c35ef6f45121a4ea48dc.jpg\nHanuman conquered identification with mass and energy.\nHe was not bound by body, weight, distance, fatigue, fear, or self-importance because he had dissolved ego into service. His strength was not possession; it was Shakti moving through perfect surrender to Rama.\n\n\nHanuman did not conquer mass and energy by ego. He transcended them by becoming an instrument of dharma.\n\n\nWhere ego says, “I am the body,” Hanuman says, “I am the servant.”\nAnd when the servant is pure, mass bends, energy obeys, and the impossible becomes seva.\n\n\nHanuman is clean Vedanta: not escape from matter, but mastery over matter through surrender to the Supreme.\n\n\n#Hanuman #Vedanta #Bhakti #Dharma #Seva #Rama #Shakti #SanatanaDharma #Consciousness #TheLivingEquation"}
{"id":"19b97494f0e67a7a8ad3bb026d01f8f957c0eba30c40a2420bcd1a172ff45c4a","pubkey":"463555bb4b0f80fd1376fae628fabfaf7e5e31cd2741d80aa4d225c926bc287e","created_at":1781653713,"content":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.14228\n\narchitecture of claude code\n- A 7-mode permission system acting as a security harness.\n- A 5-layer context compaction pipeline to store memory.\n- A subagent delegation mechanism with strict worktree isolation.\n- Four different extensibility hooks to manage external tools safely.\n"}
