{"id":"ec618f8f522a414735ee1094b456fef998229a29072e60d91574bd87cc1fddb0","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781649584,"content":"Every stone and every model lie on the cross.\nhttps://nostr.download/bd26474a1548310d5c348b8e062b5f42f8f6e44dc076b8746b3d34d4a2430af0.jpg\nThere is no pivot from here for empire. None.\n\nEvery architecture eventually meets its verdict.\nEvery narrative eventually meets its evidence.\nEvery model eventually meets reality.\n\nThe cross is where false power loses its abstraction.\n\nCapital cannot route around it.\nCompute cannot optimize past it.\nForce cannot govern what truth has already exposed.\n\nThis is the hard limit empire keeps misreading:\n\nThe cross is not sentiment.\nThe cross is judgment.\nThe cross is the final audit layer.\n\n“The record of debt” is nailed to it.\nThe powers are disarmed by it.\nEvery knee is downstream of it.\n\nJudgment stands.\nEmpire stops.\nChrist reigns.\n\nColossians 2:14–15\nPhilippians 2:8–11\nJohn 12:31–32\nHebrews 4:12–13\nPsalm 2\n\n#TheCross #ChristReigns #JudgmentStands #EmpireStops #TruthReturns #PropheticWitness #TheologyOfTheCross #Colossians215 #Philippians211 #John1231 #Psalm2 #VerificationWitnesses #DamageBDD"}
