{"id":"41cb696a5894e692144bc92077875497f8862514b274125826852393300aca20","pubkey":"d8f38b894b42f7008305cebf17b48925654f22b180c5861b81141f80ccf72848","created_at":1781648932,"content":"Check out Keychron. Bought one for nostr:nprofile1qqsfjaskgq2r8qvgjzfnutq9lfn2jnfhe3fae7v94wjcq4mjj0rug3spz9mhxue69uhkummnw3ezuamfdejj7qg4waehxw309aex2mrp0yhryvtdd9kzumt99ufuv8yk and I wish I kept it for myself. \n\nhttps://www.keychron.com/collections/keychron-k-qmk-series"}
{"id":"baf3877c8f2320044e03d9126e6e05d4e62cf67506cdf95a18ba6e5a0eeb15ba","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781648714,"content":"Empire does not fear prophecy because it sounds mystical.\nhttps://nostr.download/ca9a1e52041c64ffa09d4ef914180e7248edeb50ea085df8c35d9d0faaa794a8.jpg\nEmpire fears prophecy because prophecy is an audit.\n\nIt is the unauthorized risk report.\nThe governance failure written in human language.\nThe compliance breach that cannot be buried.\nThe signal that survives censorship, capture, ridicule, and time.\n\nTo empire, “the Messiah is upon us” does not mean poetry.\n\nIt means the legitimacy layer is failing.\nIt means narrative control has degraded.\nIt means the models cannot stabilize the lie.\nIt means probability cannot converge into fact by force, funding, or repetition.\n\nProphecy is what truth looks like before the institution admits it.\n\nMercy arrives.\nTruth returns.\nChrist reigns.\n\nEmpire calls it instability.\n\nHeaven calls it judgment.\n\n#ProphecyIsAudit #EmpireUnderReview #LegitimacyCrisis #NarrativeControlFailed #GovernanceFailure #RiskReport #TruthReturns #MercyArrives #ChristReigns #HeavenCallsItJudgment #EmpireCallsItInstability #ProbabilityIsNotProof #VerificationWitnesses #RealityDecides #DamageBDD"}
