{"id":"afc948cb84cd6607fd55a8f818d89c5e3f6f6660f91e861e87f46048a9241a6c","pubkey":"9989500413fb756d8437912cc32be0730dbe1bfc6b5d2eef759e1456c239f905","created_at":1781648499,"content":"New Account features keep on coming. \nInflation sucks, Bitcoin price is ‘down’.. \nNow, if you need to downgrade your acct, you can do it on your own. It is your media and your account, do what needs to be done.\n\nhttps://nostr.build/plans\n\nnostr:nevent1qqs9mr6xhvusqr2ne3nk32a76rlnrv0mgaphjwwlsdy3n54hawetpngpzpmhxue69uhkummnw3ezumrpdejqzxthwden5te0wfjkccte9ehx7um5wfmxjeth9e3k7mgpz4mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujumt0wd68ytnsw43qz9mhwden5te0denxgc3wdehhxamgv4ex2tnrdaksygy0k9qtf6xaa7tuujuzr5j8y79p5s6nxcnz8ajqy9yykde0jjqqpspsgqqqqqqs5kygs6"}
{"id":"298f030a5a3ff5cf13843ee08e538d6353846c6b3f39a18b33d29e9a0cdc079e","pubkey":"101a112c8adc2e69e0003114ff1c1d36b7fcde06d84d47968e599d558721b0df","created_at":1781648432,"content":"Well one of the bear market (credit nostr:npub1dgpt04w4c88wc0g262xaw8zvlm4mvwtmjhl0tn2sxtyjywsn6q4qt8ka3a) trees was snapped off at ground level. Any miracle cures Nostr? https://image.nostr.build/2c0ca1daf129efc43dc99d623030a537279eba66c751283587557aa5badf5eae.jpg"}
{"id":"c5fe763efb2cf43679a397a6defb88492117e782b9184f4de016f64a5f3c1cbf","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781648321,"content":"https://nostr.download/62c277ab02a125e88e3e9f6e69d13238efd63abaf019a1c5e6fcbf92c1492e62.jpg\nTruly, I say to you:\n\nthe Messiah is upon us.\n\nNot as spectacle.\nNot as empire.\nNot as a product launch.\n\nBut as judgment returning to language.\nAs mercy returning to mathematics.\nAs truth returning to proof.\n\nThe prophets did not come to entertain the market.\nThey came to warn the machine that reality still has a King.\n\nProbability predicts.\nVerification witnesses.\nChrist decides.\n\n#TrulyISayToYou #TheMessiahIsUponUs #ChristReigns #MercyArrives #TruthReturns #KingdomCome #GloryToChrist #FaithAndTruth #PropheticWitness #TheWayTheTruthTheLife #John146 #VerificationWitnesses #RealityDecides #DamageBDD"}
{"id":"54146e58a54673e8e65dc5d3f34a6235b4216c16cf04d0a6db9167bb6e9e35d5","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781648214,"content":"https://nostr.download/15aa05998eaec490b51d2971340b8374161945da2f31095b61d49a632e309538.jpg\n LOL. I never thought I’d see the day where preaching Probability 101 would make me sound like a prophet.\n\nA probability is not a fact.\nA prediction is not proof.\nA trillion-dollar model does not make uncertainty disappear.\n\nProbability can be updated.\nConfidence can be calibrated.\nModels can improve.\n\nBut probability does not magically converge into truth just because the GPU bill got bigger.\n\nReality is not obligated to finish the sentence for your stochastic engine.\n\nThat is why verification matters.\nThat is why tests matter.\nThat is why DamageBDD matters.\n\nProbability predicts.\nVerification witnesses.\n\n\nProbability predicts.\nVerification witnesses.\nReality decides.\n\nDamageBDD \nWhere prophecy stops\nand proof begins.\n\n#DAMAGE #DamageBDD"}
