{"id":"acd734ce30483b549973d47df9aa098cc321aa62c63de317f07444647d94c6dc","pubkey":"d3de41d408a33090fa0c4e89093def3ae7ee86f3e3d1286beea5e53f566fff7b","created_at":1781638090,"content":"nostr:npub1q3sle0kvfsehgsuexttt3ugjd8xdklxfwwkh559wxckmzddywnws6cd26p \nnostr:npub18ams6ewn5aj2n3wt2qawzglx9mr4nzksxhvrdc4gzrecw7n5tvjqctp424 \nboth of you are nostr tech pioneers right? I think there is an unsolved problem with nostr livestreaming, anyone should be able to do it with just a browser for free in a way that can scale.\n\nSo I was wondering if something like https://demo.cdnbye.com/ nostrfied would work as a protocol.\nSomeone streams directly in their app / browser to a webrtc room, the viewers help seed the content to make it scale. \n\nInfra wise that can hopefully be very lightweight so that anyone can put up a basic webrtc server to facilitate it."}
