{"id":"2ad748b7098b22790f61c3405417064dd4fa2e35980c194aa6029943532c6c6b","pubkey":"f527cf970ce260e74261214bf612e8f75a59db1835ed7e4053326c3f65e232ee","created_at":1781623703,"content":"The #NoorNote onboarding just got a little simpler and a bit more tailored for Muslims and Christians.\n\nI took the whole relay management section out of the onboarding wizard. NoorNote now just picks the best relays for new users automatically, including the right inbox relays for NIP-17 DMs. If someone knows what they’re doing and wants to handle it themselves, they can still do that in the relay settings after onboarding. The choice made during onboarding can always be changed.\n\nI also added 2 checkboxes in the bio section for religious affiliation. This only affects which thematic relays get added. If someone selects 'Muslim', it adds noornode.nostr1.com and bitcoinmajlis.nostr1.com. If they select 'Christian', it adds theforest.nostr1.com. [npub1m4ny6hjqzepn4rxknuq94c2gpqzr29ufkkw7ttcxyak7v43n6vvsajc2jl, I hope I got this right that the relay is moderated according to your values]. That’s it. Nothing about this gets published anywhere else, it only impacts relay selection.\n\nhttps://image.nostr.build/6f71a0dba6e944eb4fd58000223130682e843ae46b7a0aef0502716c37c599ec.png\n\nhttps://image.nostr.build/d29859a8d7b1d2bd5b7f65d0e3851120d1236e3a5cb91486f79199c502d310a0.png\n\nIf you don’t care about it, you can just skip it. I don’t know of any other faith-based thematic relays, but if you do, let me know and I’ll add them the same way."}
