{"id":"241f3163953c2e5733d89e233a1d0ba87119f67b0301cb565b7a04bbad8612f8","pubkey":"cec0f44d0d64d6d9d7a1c84c330f5467e752cc8b065f720e874a0bed1c5416d2","created_at":1781608110,"content":"The amazingly talented nostr:nprofile1qy38wue69uhh2mtzwfjkctn5v95kcvp3vyuryvfww3ejumn9wsargwp58qq3qamn8ghj7atdvfex2mp6xsurgwqqyzaww7r5j3hvzy0ef0je4meg9hsf9hzt4usnlrkt3j0ptjm76ucyuqjwrkg  came up with a cool concept called Nimdolf: Non-interactive Mint Delegation on Liveness Failure\n\nThis is a major step towards removing the custodial risk of Cashu. It provides a \"Dead Mint Switch\" in case an mint goes offline for an extended period of time.\n\nCould use a better acronym though... haha. I was thinking maybe, RESCUE: Reserve Escrow Scripted Custodial User Exit\n\nLMK if you think of a better one!\n\nhttps://x.com/lukechilds/status/2062131136386793979/\nhttps://gist.github.com/lukechilds/302e7fa04b09d6e4568bdcd64cb43356"}
{"id":"8c13366a1e571dde329dfba854da1f3cc44d652ab09bec95fe80d20c663afa35","pubkey":"6f7db55a0d92aa52d2fb3f52c39c320b04bd2cacbf9fb41d745124e5985d8b25","created_at":1781608109,"content":"Wall World Strategy\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/403e3d433f54c412e70200dc5843a48d8f1036e38a8eebf79cb73fcdb42c5afa.mp4\n\nBuild and lead a colony on the surface of an endless Wall. Manage resources and your people, develop new technologies, defend against relentless zyrex attacks, and send robo-spiders on risky expeditions. Keep the colony from collapsing – in Wall World, it's easy to fall.\n\nhttps://store.steampowered.com/app/4218360/Wall_World_Strategy/\n\nhttps://plebs.app/#/video/405df1eb5f1be09c0e48a90d0f2565a66529c18fb7f344c41742be9ae62c2351"}
