{"id":"edcf286978f91ee86c134dd8b3fd354a48d6ea32ff91e50eaaf4495d6ee139ec","pubkey":"fd0266485777bd73e97c7c37f520c83c82e362fe4c25a6be93f3380083d4646b","created_at":1781595724,"content":"On June 20th, we're throwing a Hashparty. 🎉\n\nAll day long, 11:00 AM to midnight (CET), we're pointing hashrate at Go Brrr Pool and trying to find a block together.\n\nNo shared reward. No tricks. Everyone mines to their own address. We just want to see Go Brrr Pool find a block, and want to do it with you.\n\nA Bitaxe counts. A rack of S21s counts, everything in between counts. Rentals welcome too!\n\nWhile we hash, we'll hang out in Discord and talk Bitcoin, tech, mining, projects. Giveaways included!\n\nIf you run hashrate, this is your invite. See you on the 20th. ⛏\nhttps://image.nostr.build/57a13c929e19ebe9ddcafed1d5c6c5b4bb522461a25b57a70d3468fa9abbb861.png"}
