{"id":"4b2465d454eed284d65af75b9e9d9f8e5e6109598d7dddfecf18f8148cd970bb","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1781580218,"content":"Sun Tzu teaches battlefield deception.\nhttps://nostr.download/95ac30daacceea8f4fc38d41ae1355a85c3875ab112fe930c70a27b758a66507.jpg\nChanakya goes deeper.\n\nChanakya Neeti is not just about defeating an enemy’s story. It is about governing power through policy, intelligence, treasury, incentives, discipline, audit, and consequence.\n\nThat is why ECAI aligns more naturally with Chanakya than Sun Tzu.\n\nA model can be deceived by yesterday’s pattern.\n\nBut a verified system can force power to answer in real time.\n\nECAI is not merely prediction.\n\nIt is behavioural statecraft:\nwho acted,\nwhat changed,\nwhat damage occurred,\nwho verified it,\nand what consequence follows.\n\nSun Tzu defeats the mind.\n\nChanakya audits the kingdom.\n\nMath bro. It is done.\n\n#ECAI #ChanakyaNeeti #Arthashastra #DamageBDD #VerificationEconomy #AIAlignment #BehaviourVerification #Statecraft #Incentives #AuditTrail #ProofOfBehaviour #SovereignSystems"}
